  "prompt": "Xét tính liên tục của các hàm số sau\n\t<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\t\t<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\t\t<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\t\t<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.<ol class=\"alpha-list\"></ol>",
